college, who may be the only person that knows anything pertaining to the disappearance. The only ones in frequent contact with the headmaster are the heads of the college dormitories, known as the Prefect 4 (P4): Edgar Redmond, Lawrence Bluewer, Herman Greenhill, and Gregory Violet.\n\nCiel must concoct a plan to get in the P4's good graces if he wants to use their connections to succeed in his mission. But the distinguished college and its students hide much that is unseen, making this task more improbable than he could imagine.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"School","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Butler","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Historical","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Boarding School","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Demons","rank":91,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Crime","rank":90,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Anti-Hero","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Royal Affairs","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Orphan","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Teacher","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Male Cast","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Zombie","rank":73,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Shounen","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"CGI","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Bullying","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gore","rank":46,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Black Butler: Public School Arc","english":"Black Butler: Public School Arc","native":"黒執事 寄宿学校編","romaji":"Kuroshitsuji: Kishuku Gakkou-hen","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"黒執事 -寄宿学校編-"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"黑执事 -寄宿学校篇-"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Kuroshitsuji: Kishuku Gakkou Hen"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Kuroshitsuji - Kishuku Gakkou-hen"}]},"trailer":{"id":"N1SqCDrwPLc","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/N1SqCDrwPLc/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}